  "title": "SIFCO Industries, Inc. (“SIFCO”) Announces Third Quarter and First Nine Months of Fiscal 2026 Financial Results",
  "summary": "Cleveland — SIFCO Industries, Inc. (NYSE American: SIF) today announced financial results for its third quarter and first nine months of fiscal 2026, which ended June 30, 2026. Third Quarter Results Net sales in the third quarter of fiscal 2026 increased 3% to $26.1 million, compared with $22.1 million for the same period in fiscal 2025. Net",
